    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/3b6ab643aef2dc38e094e13cea10fbb3.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Outwit and outplay your friends in first-to-3 style matches. Joust with your pals; only one can remain victorious on the battlefield.<br>Action packed and super fast, each round is a quick fight, great for passing the controller at parties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.poster.avif?t=1647585265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.webm?t=1647585265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.mp4?t=1647585265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/6658810f4b0b6d5b7576fecda100e62d.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Simple stick controls are used to maneuver your vehicle, and two buttons to either jump over your opponents or smash them into the air! The controls are easy, but learning to outwit and bait your friends is the fun part.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f46d2dd35e6c5a612fa27e2d18d6aaad.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Choose your warrior, from the not-so-sweet Nigiri to the gruff Business Toast. Find a hat that truly speaks to you (and try not to lose it in the rush of battle). Pick a paint job that makes your heart sing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/bf895b1ab050ff0551f6283bc0d5ac36.avif?t=1647585265\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/1c7029e2e52de2de71aac37a63518a36.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Ranging from a peaceful stony outcropping to a deadly lava lair, pick an arena that will challenge you and your friends.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/febffa2b519c2c192129c69df86ac749.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Play against some rather friendly or vicious AI; great for blowing off steam or getting some practice in.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/c17f75d54ea41746b6738811d4889f42.avif?t=1647585265\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/3b6ab643aef2dc38e094e13cea10fbb3.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Outwit and outplay your friends in first-to-3 style matches. Joust with your pals; only one can remain victorious on the battlefield.<br>Action packed and super fast, each round is a quick fight, great for passing the controller at parties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.poster.avif?t=1647585265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.webm?t=1647585265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f938c3ff4e5efc3064d9048565432026.mp4?t=1647585265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/6658810f4b0b6d5b7576fecda100e62d.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Simple stick controls are used to maneuver your vehicle, and two buttons to either jump over your opponents or smash them into the air! The controls are easy, but learning to outwit and bait your friends is the fun part.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/f46d2dd35e6c5a612fa27e2d18d6aaad.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Choose your warrior, from the not-so-sweet Nigiri to the gruff Business Toast. Find a hat that truly speaks to you (and try not to lose it in the rush of battle). Pick a paint job that makes your heart sing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/bf895b1ab050ff0551f6283bc0d5ac36.avif?t=1647585265\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/1c7029e2e52de2de71aac37a63518a36.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Ranging from a peaceful stony outcropping to a deadly lava lair, pick an arena that will challenge you and your friends.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/febffa2b519c2c192129c69df86ac749.webp?t=1647585265\" /></div><br>Play against some rather friendly or vicious AI; great for blowing off steam or getting some practice in.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299000/extras/c17f75d54ea41746b6738811d4889f42.avif?t=1647585265\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Use your driving, jumping, and jousting skills to knock out rival breakfast foods in this wild local party game for up to 4. Grab one of six characters and get ready to get Toasted!",
